WHO   — VIDEO — the stream · space × time
WHAT  — The top of the ladder: conceptually just still-photo × time + audio, so the console can stage it as a sequence — but true video synthesis or comprehension needs a model.
WHERE — HRM · Hermeneus  Framework inputs: the machine dialect, interpreted by ROOT0  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
